flowchart TD
  UI[Compose UI & Settings] --> Domain[Command and Automation Domain]
  AIS[VoiceInteractionService] --> Hotword[Local Wake Word]
  Hotword --> Speaker[Owner Verification]
  Speaker --> ASR[Offline Speech Recognition]
  ASR --> NLU[Typed Intent Parser / Dialogue]
  NLU --> Domain
  Sched[Scheduler + Context Events] --> Automations[Automation Engine]
  Learn[Opt-in Learning] --> Proposal[Suggestion Review]
  Proposal -->|Explicit Approval| Automations
  Automations --> Domain
  Domain --> Policy[Security & Permissions]
  Policy --> Router[Action Router]
  Router --> Android[Android APIs]
  Router --> Access[AccessibilityService]
  Router --> Root[Typed Magisk Root Bridge]
  Domain <--> Data[(Room + DataStore + Encrypted Store)]
  Policy --> Logs[Execution Ledger & Outcomes]
  Logs --> Data
